# Reproducible hashes for append-only research evidence and preregistrations.
# Rules for EA_SonicR/ and EA_VolmanCausalGrammar/ were dropped 2026-08-31:
# EA_SonicR moved to the gitignored graveyard, EA_VolmanCausalGrammar never
# existed in this checkout. Re-add a rule when the path it guards exists.
# The real filenames are the whole PRO_TRADER_REPLACEMENT_* preregistration
# family (…_EXECUTION_FREEZE_V1.json, …_TIMING_EXECUTION_LOCK_V2.json, locks,
# contracts, epochs). Cover the family, not one stale prefix. (2026-09-11)
**/PRO_TRADER_REPLACEMENT_*.json text eol=lf
**/PRO_TRADER_REPLACEMENT_*.jsonl text eol=lf
# The registry ledger is hash-bound per raw row: validate_candidate_registry.py
# freezes sha256 over each row body (minus the single terminal LF) and over the
# whole file, so a CRLF checkout breaks the frozen HYP007/ROUND-CASCADE row
# identities. Keep the ledger LF-only on every platform.
"04. Memory/research/CANDIDATE_REGISTRY.jsonl" text eol=lf
.githooks/pre-commit text eol=lf
